SUMMARY:Deadline: Cities Deliver: AI Solutions for Public Services (Rockefe
 ller Foundation and OpenAI Foundation\, USD 500\,000 to 2 million)
DESCRIPTION:A USD 50 million open call from the Rockefeller Foundation and 
 OpenAI Foundation for organisations working with city governments to impro
 ve public services through AI\, especially for underserved communities. FO
 CUS AREAS: public health\, economic mobility\, environmental resilience an
 d civic engagement (projects on voting or elections are excluded).\n\nOrga
