SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: A MAZE. / Berlin 2027: game and playful media s
 ubmissions (16th festival\, 5 to 8 May 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 10 Jan 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nA MAZE. / Berlin is an inte
 rnational festival for independent and arthouse games and playful media\; 
 its 16th edition runs 5 to 8 May 2027 in Berlin and online.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: A MAZE. GmbH\nLocation: Berlin\, Germany and online (festival 5 to 8 Ma
 y 2027). Open worldwide to individuals aged 16 or older and to business en
 tities.\nAward: EXCEPTION: NOT FUNDED (festival call). Submissions enter t
 he A MAZE. Awards: EUR 2\,000 each for the Most Amazing Award and the WING
 S Award\, EUR 1\,000 each for the Human-Human-Machine\, Long Feature\, Dig
 ital Moment\, Explorer and Audience Awards. Nominees get exhibition build-
 up and tech plus 2 festival passes\; travel is not covered. Non-refundable
  submission fee per entry: Early Bird EUR 35\, Regular EUR 50\, or 'Artist
  in need' tickets at EUR 10 each\; optional Feedback add-on EUR 30.\nDurat
 ion: 4-day festival\, 5 to 8 May 2027\; award ceremony 7 May 2027.\n\nMore
 : https://2027.award.amaze-berlin.de/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
